==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|надписа́ть|t1=to [[caption]], to write an [[inscription]] on|-ь}}, with typical stress shift (compare {{m|ru|по́дпись}}, {{m|ru|за́пись}}, etc.).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|на́дпись}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-надпись.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|на́дпись|f}}

# [[inscription]], [[writing]], [[label]]
# [[dedication]] {{q|on a book}}
# [[address]] {{q|on an envelope}}
# [[legend]] {{q|on a coin, medal, map}}

